  "gate_text": "DROP: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 9\n\n**Reasoning:**\n- **1 (syntaxin-2 measurement)**: A protein measurement with no direct bearing on neurodevelopmental disorder diagnosis or pathology\n- **2 (body weight)**: A general physical measurement unrelated to neurodevelopment\n- **3 (venous thromboembolism)**: A vascular/clotting disorder with no biological route to neurodevelopmental traits\n- **4 (disease recurrence)**: A generic clinical outcome measure not specific to any disease system\n- **5 (malunion fracture)**: An orthopedic complication unrelated to neurodevelopment\n- **9 (malignant hyperthermia of anesthesia)**: A pharmacogenetic anesthetic reaction unrelated to neurodevelopment\n\nAll others are kept because they are movement disorders, dyskinesias, dystonia, tremors, myoclonus, or parkinsonism\u2014conditions that are either neurodevelopmental themselves, commonly co-occur with neurodevelopmental disorders, or represent neurological manifestations that could plausibly relate to the same genetic etiology.",
